      "title": "Explicit coloring certificates, exact verification, and certificate-relative extension analysis",
      "summary": "This program organizes explicit finite Schur-coloring certificates, exact verification, and analysis of extensions relative to the fixed Fredricksen–Sweet coloring through 536. It now includes blocker counts at 537, a Hamming-distance decomposition, SAT/LRAT verification machinery, and a qualified radius-43 exclusion claim. The supplied evidence does not certify the universal radius exclusion, a coloring through 537, a new upper bound, or the value of S(6).",
