      "nodeType": "method",
      "title": "SAT encoding and RUP/LRAT checking method for the radius-43 cases",
      "summary": "The exact CNF encoding and RUP-only LRAT checker are logically appropriate for the four remaining conditioned radius-43 cases. The formulas enforce exactly one color, all Schur constraints through 537, the selected color of 537, and the corresponding extra-change bounds 0, 5, 11, and 8. The checker architecture is sound, but the four decisive LRAT payloads are unavailable, so the formulas' unsatisfiability is not certified by the supplied artifacts.",
